{
  "name": "Omnilex Engine",
  "icon": "theoreticalsciences:omnilex_engine",
  "category": "theoreticalsciences:endgame",
  "sortnum": 52,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:omnilex_engine",
      "title": "Omnilex Engine",
      "text": "It simulates the World Tree and the Ocean of Primordial Law - and so controls them. Only works in Hyperdimensional Reality Space.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 8$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Too complex for any crafting grid. I built this controller on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts; I needed every one of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This engine will only run in $(thing)Hyperdimensional Reality Space$(), and is built partly from the World Tree itself. It simulates the $(thing)Tree$() and the $(thing)Ocean$() - first separately as $(item)Simulacra$(), then together."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "A perfect model of a thing is, in the end, a handle on it. Whoever holds the resulting $(item)Omnilex$() is no longer bound by gravity."
    },
